{"t":"The Crystal Caves","s":"the-crystal-caves-053e3","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Crystal_Spider_d6d4c0.gif","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The Crystal Caves is a stage in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a> and is the route to The Mirror Maze of Madness. It is the first stage leading to the demon boss <a href=\"#/wiki/Zugurosh\">Zugurosh</a>. Players arrive here after slaying <a href=\"#/wiki/Ushuriel\">Ushuriel</a> in The Dark Path.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a>, The Dark Path, The Mirror Maze of Madness, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Zugurosh\">Zugurosh</a> </i> </span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\"><img alt=\"Crystal Spider\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Crystal_Spider_d6d4c0.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Spider\">Crystal Spider</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,250</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">358</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-197× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">